{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|87CD50104988FCCDDC7C8DA8D7388E05", "source_en": "Mmmhmm.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ممم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|87D6BD914313F3133A0DC5A844FAB9D8", "source_en": "Hmmm. Here. Gajov learned what Gajov needed. Take the staff. No need for it.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هممم. خذ. قاجوف تعلم ما يحتاجه قاجوف. خذ العصا. لا حاجة لها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|8C1DB7F2416EC27ED0CEBBB470AC505F", "source_en": "Time for forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "وقت الصهر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|8C752B934AF347768749C490FAD0CD5A", "source_en": "Use Gajov. Get strong.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "استخدم قاجوف. كن قوياً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|8D0051D04AE3FE0C5E70428997534ABD", "source_en": "Forge or leave.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اصهر أو ارحل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|8D434D914301E33EE7CB6A80F274A156", "source_en": "Gajov ready.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف جاهز.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|8EE3066143F4B3C58C4A11AC976853F7", "source_en": "Take list. Bring everything. Gajov help you kill a god.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ القائمة. أحضر كل شيء. قاجوف يساعدك تقتل إله.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|900FE5174D7964AF513751A5B7EFBE37", "source_en": "More material for the fire.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "مواد أكثر للنار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9122CF9944CDFF2572E7898D92909CD6", "source_en": "Come see Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تعال شوف قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|912AB3934ABCF074CA0EA8A165E32D35", "source_en": "Forge hot.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حدادة حارة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9168E2AA4B420F370227AE987E5DB683", "source_en": "Blood. Bring blood!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "دم. أحضر دم!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|922661674B569E5299B5108D10F47082", "source_en": "Bring Gajov material... Gajov forge blade!...", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر قاجوف مواد... قاجوف يطرق نصل!...", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|95EB218441608B3A5D6A5E9F02A33502", "source_en": "(grunts)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|96D9E04D44871D9DF4063BB4C13A4251", "source_en": "No waste Gajov's time.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا تضيع وقت قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|970583334C63240E57D7CFA54D69BE10", "source_en": "Gajov once lost pup too.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف فقد جروه من قبل أيضاً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9823DCC94496087279797B8AEA9902D3", "source_en": "Gajov seen many clergy fall victim to vampirism. Many by his own fangs. Hmm. The Cardinal's staff intrigues Gajov. Help him reforge it.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف رأى كثير من رجال الدين يقعون ضحية مصاصي الدماء. كثير منهم بأنيابه هو. همم. عصا الكاردينال تثير فضول قاجوف. ساعده في إعادة صهرها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9D142D794EE126ED0ABA3F9FC2DF7A7D", "source_en": "Gajov like choice.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يعجب بالاختيار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9D6FAFAA4D52E2F71003EBBA6AFE7EC7", "source_en": "Gajov have task.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف لديه مهمة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9E1694DB4E2CF68F2B3868BDAF8C33F4", "source_en": "New toy for Nephilim.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لعبة جديدة للنيفيليم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9E4C2FC44C0242E2CCCED1ABD03FEEFD", "source_en": "Return when dull.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "إرجاع عند ثلم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9E624EBF4CBD8BF926DFB5AD0420C9A5", "source_en": "Respect Gajov time.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "احترم وقت قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9EF6C7244A96BDA2BCE328B2507D17A8", "source_en": "When it come to forge, Gajov know best.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "عند الأمر بالحدادة، قاجوف يعرف أفضل.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9F50F19A490A8CC3AB3CE8B0B83B002B", "source_en": "Gajov busy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف مشغول.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|9F9BD307496F476353E7D0BE982AD7B0", "source_en": "Don't waste Gajov time.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا تضيع وقت قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A0F5F31C41AE639241BB07822B288AFF", "source_en": "Give to Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أعطِ لقاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A0FD231A439E2DDB3FEC86A7E1FBC236", "source_en": "Huh? Oh, you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هه؟ أوه، أنت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A17438B24A175844AD50CA82C08758FF", "source_en": "Need forge?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "تحتاج حدادة؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A2CAAE0B42F19304DC0192B5230AF38E", "source_en": "Please, help fix.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أرجوك، ساعد إصلاح.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A3D98E4A49B8E1B280FF0295A8F01450", "source_en": "More material, more forge. Simple.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "مواد أكثر، حدادة أكثر. بسيط.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A5883EB148F5594D27A39581F784ADD7", "source_en": "Bring Gajov all of list or no toy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر لقاجوف كل القائمة أو لا لعبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A7A4306549A60F70817C299F68A5658C", "source_en": "(growl)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|A87F864A4D21D260988EBCB5DC0BF120", "source_en": "Gajov best blacksmith.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف أفضل حداد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|AA46C6AB411389A0875E079C90956BFD", "source_en": "This most important thing.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "هذا أهم شيء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|AB09F1F442C4DA09E5D536ACBDC52643", "source_en": "Blood. Gajov need blood.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "دم. قاجوف يحتاج دم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B037EB6B40C6EF972F9FB0B6B3EC1BCC", "source_en": "Special fire in Ramshorn Keep. You take for Gajov.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "نار خاصة في حصن رامزهورن. أنت تجلبها لقاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B0B2F4B5484E89A1FA20C5A5022A0156", "source_en": "You're like Gallant. Gajov trust you.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أنت مثل قالانت. قاجوف يثق بك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B1676C5A4C0E46E5C2C4BCB8C8F9A41E", "source_en": "Smithing?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "صهر؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B34D6F514EEE8E123952D4AFFD30E08B", "source_en": "That Beast. Warden. Its strength is still of use. Help Gajov forge a mighty weapon from it. It will be yours.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ذلك الوحش. الحارس. قوته لا تزال نافعة. ساعد قاجوف لصهر سلاح عظيم منه. سيكون لك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B6B89E8543FD5176DF0BDA8A1F77C799", "source_en": "But Gajov hear stories. In Ramshorn Keep burns special fire.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لكن قاجوف سمع قصصاً. في حصن رامزهورن يحترق نار خاصة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B75448454AAE330AC9A387AEBF929717", "source_en": "Hmm not everything on list.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "همم، ليس كل شيء في القائمة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B8B1273F4E15590A6536F1825902BBA7", "source_en": "You, go Ramshorn Keep. Bring Gajov special fire.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أنت، اذهب لحصن رامزهورن. أحضر لقاجوف النار الخاصة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|B9D568094B39C28E3568E09B26484D67", "source_en": "Gajov hate waste time.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يكره ضياع الوقت.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|BAFF19A64DC618DC157128AAFDB2CD39", "source_en": "Sharp.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حاد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 6}}
